            "notes": "# Why this power? \n[Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb)  is a good power for the first round as it enables you to earn even more money which can be crucial.\n\n# Items\nYou will want some extra padding even if it's only 30 HP om total, it can be an absolute lifesaver. \nEspecially  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) is huge when running away from for example a junkrat.",
