            "notes": "For this round you will want to start actually working on the build, which is why you are going to take  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) to get faster CD and be able to rez safely. Sell the  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) but keep  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) as it's still crucial for a long time in this build.",
