            "notes": "# Power\nThis round you will pick either  [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) or  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) depending on how it's going. If you find yourself being hunted after a rez, you will want  [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) to increase your survival at least a bit, otherwise you will go with crazy heals + boost during the short valk time. \n\n# Items\nLet's increase our HP even more to be annoying,  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) is amazing for that, not only does it decrease your CD but it will increase the chances of staying alive after rez or even during the round greatly, the overhealth only lasts 3 seconds, but those 3 seconds can be crucial. \nThe  [Meka Z-Series](item_358d93ab-617b-41e7-8df3-ac78d0d8c680) is simply there to increase the HP more for the time being, which is why it's optional to buy.",
